everyone knows what a Jedi is but who's  in charge of the Jedi Order and what  happens to trainees who don't pass their  tests if you're wondering about the  hierarchy of the galaxy's guardians of  justice and peace here's your guide the  lowest rank in the Jedi hierarchy are  Jedi younglings also known as initiating  to the book Jedi versus Sith the  essential guide to the force younglings  are children sensitive to the force who  were gathered from across the galaxy is  infants to be trained as future Jedi the  Jedi path a manual for students of the  forest explains that at one time young  adults and adolescents were recruited as  Jedi younglings but the order found that  these older recruits were already  exposed to negative emotions that could  push them to the dark side as a result  the Jedi began recruiting children who  were younger and more innocent  younglings don't train with mentors  one-on-one instead they're separated  into small groups called clans and  trained together within those clans once  younglings learn the basics they must  take a series of tests known as the  initiate which have included such tasks  as building a lightsaber though the  initiative changed over time their  ultimate goal is to determine students  knowledge of the Jedi Code and ability  to conquer the dark side  unlike the group training for younglings  Padawans receive one-on-one coaching and  real-life missions a significant hurdle  for most Padawans to clear similar to  younglings Padawans must also pass a  series of trials to move up in rank  these tests include the trial of skill  the trial of courage the trial of flesh  the trial of spirit in the trial of  insight the trials test a Padawans  mental and physical abilities and  determine if they are ready to become a  full-fledged Jedi the force is with you  young Skywalker  you on budget I yet not every Padawan  graduates to the rank of Jedi Knight but  unsuccessful initiates can still become  members of the Jedi service corps the  organization is separated into four arms  agricultural medical educational and  exploration the agricultural core uses  the Force to help ensure that the  Republic has enough food to go around  the Medical Corps is considered one of  the most advanced medical organizations  in the Republic with its members  performing specialized procedures and  triage work on battlefields across the  galaxy the educational Corps worked with  the Jedi archives translating and  updating records the most exciting  branch is arguably the exploration Corps  whose members are sent to the far-flung  corners of space to make new discoveries  Jedi Knights are full-fledged members of  the order expected to uphold peace in  the galaxy and the ideals of the Jedi  Code the most common way to become a  Jedi Knight is by passing trials as a  Padawan but an individual can also be  granted the title by performing a heroic  deed like obi-wan Kenobi assuming the  rank after defeating Darth Maul at this  point in the hierarchy Jedi Knights  still have much to learn about the force  but they no longer carry out their  duties under the direct supervision of a  Jedi Master  most Jedi Knights carry out their  missions alone testing their  self-discipline and upholding the  principles of the Jedi Code when people  think of the Jedi two things usually  come to mind the force and lightsabers  who are the Jedi in many cases those who  specialized in the manipulation of the  force pursue the title of Jedi Council  are most of these Jedi are focused on  using their connection to the force to  resolve conflicts in a peaceful way the  most esteemed Jedi consular masters  serve on the reconciliation council a  select group of Jedi who work directly  with the Republic diplomatic corps to  engage in diplomacy and interplanetary  relations there are many different ways  for jedi consulars to use their talents  within the order jedi seers use deep  meditation to connect to the force and  receive visions of the past present and  future  for instance the prophecy of the one who  will bring balance to the force was the  product of visions received by Jedi  seers who recorded their findings in the  Jedi archives other counselors become  Jedi healers who use their connection to  the forest to mend broken bodies other's  work as Jedi ambassadors and Jedi  diplomats serving as representative  and various government bodies in  activist movements respectively other  councillors might become Jedi lore  keepers dedicated to maintaining the  Jedi archives in the years leading up to  the Clone Wars the Republic had no  standing army instead specialized Jedi  Knights known as Guardians acted as the  first line of defense for the galaxy  guardians are divided into three main  subclasses peacekeepers temple security  and star fighters peacekeepers act as  galactic police trained in crowd control  and de-escalation of threats Jedi  assigned to temple security protect the  Jedi Temple on the planet Khorasan as  their name implies star fighters serve  as the pilots of the Jedi Order  particularly gifted Jedi guardians may  be known as battle masters tasked with  teaching lightsaber form and technique  or Cadence's to Jedi and training some  guardians come to specialize in fighting  with weapons other than a lightsaber  being awarded the title of exotic  weapons specialists these weapons can  include whips flails blasters and even  double bladed lightsaber x' jedi  sentinels are like the orders wildcards  sentinels pursue training and  disciplines that are also available to  non force-sensitive beams in doing so  they add modern insight and skills to  the Jedi orders ancient teachings common  pursuits for Jedi sentinels include  specializing in computer systems  manipulation of technology and hacking  into and disabling security mechanisms  other sentinels do exceedingly well on  missions that require stealth and  infiltration one particular group of  sentinels known as the Jedi shadows  serve as the orders assassins in excel  at sneaky less combat oriented tasks  Jedi sentinels are also distinguished by  often remaining in one area for much  longer than other jedi acting as  watchmen for particular regions of the  galaxy if a Jedi has shown exemplary  skill deep knowledge of the force and  successfully trained an apprentice to  become a Jedi Knight they may be granted  the title of Jedi Master  don't put the Jedi Master son a master's  purpose is to be a positive force in the  galaxy and to expand the influence of  the Jedi Order what separates a Jedi  Master from a Jedi Knight is that  they're exceptional achievements and  experience make them uniquely qualified  to teach the younger members of the  order in addition to teaching younger  Jedi they are also naturally fit to lead  the order not just by example but by  sitting on one of the four Jedi councils  that govern the order the four councils  are known as the Council of first  knowledge the council of reconciliation  the Council of reassignment and the High  Council the Council of first knowledge  oversees the education of younger Jedi  and the dissemination of materials from  the Jedi archives this council is  usually comprised of counselors who  became law keepers the council of  reconciliation meanwhile deals in  politics and diplomacy this council is  also regularly filled with counselors as  well as diplomats and ambassadors the  Council of reassignment governs the Jedi  service corps dictating which body each  initiate will be funneled into after  they fail to advance on the path to Jedi  knighthood these councils are all  governed by the High Council during the  Clone Wars the High Council was made up  of five lifetime appointees for long  term appointees and three short-term  appointees making for a total of twelve  council members the High Council  oversees everything within the order and  is crucial to its stability and success  the highest-ranking member within the  High Council is given the title master  of the order this prestigious position  is only obtained by those who have  demonstrated incredible knowledge of the  ways of the Jedi in the years leading up  to the Clone Wars the title of Master of  the order was held by lifetime appointee  mace windu after the Clone Wars began  Master Windu decided to take a more  active role in commanding troops on the  battlefield and insisted that the title  be passed to Master Yoda though master  of the order is a prestigious position  they are still outranked by one final  position the Grand Master the Grand  Master is the most prestigious rank in  the Jedi hierarchy awarded to only the  wisest and most skilled the Jedi High  Council must unanimously vote to bestow  the title on to them Grand Master's  often serve in conjunction with the  master of the order leading the Jedi  High Council while at one time several  Jedi Masters could be given the title at  once that practice ended long before the  time of the Clone Wars one of the most  critical roles held by the Grand Master  to pass on their knowledge to the next  generation of Jedi part of this Duty  involves training younglings in the ways  of the force two notable figures have  achieved the title of Grandmaster during  the Clone Wars Master Yoda was  recognized as the Grand Master of the  Jedi Order afterward at least in the old  expanded universe books Luke Skywalker  invokes the title of Grand Master as he  rebuilds the Jedi Order following the  fall of the Empire check out one of our  newest videos right here plus even more  looper videos about Star Wars are coming  soon subscribe to our YouTube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one  [Music]
 

